# Unreferenced code

**Owner:** AGENTS.md, docs/ops/code-quality-and-refactor.md

- New helpers stay unexported unless a second file imports them in the same change.
- When deleting importers, drop export or delete the symbol in the same edit.
- No silence-only test imports to hide unused exports.
- Exceptions: file-based routing, dynamic import, string-keyed registries (narrow ignore + comment).
